{"connection_id":"BC-42606254a3354460771f","ref":"WLC:1Sam.30.15","status":"rejected","reason":"Egyptian demands oath against death or surrender before guiding David, but no safe home is reached.","paragraphs":[],"evidence":["WLC:1Sam.30.15"],"annotations":[]}
{"connection_id":"BC-e7f6c1f9e45477864803","ref":"WLC:2Chr.3.1","status":"rejected","reason":"Chronicles identifies Temple mount as Moriah, but verse does not narrate offering's journey or arrival.","paragraphs":[],"evidence":["WLC:2Chr.3.1"],"annotations":[]}
{"connection_id":"BC-b9a372d098f21365b6dd","ref":"WLC:2Chr.6.6","status":"rejected","reason":"Jerusalem chosen for the Name, but no offering or movement; Deut 12:11 combines them.","paragraphs":[],"evidence":["WLC:2Chr.6.6"],"annotations":[]}
{"connection_id":"BC-e68951ebbd1f7c59bce1","ref":"WLC:2Chr.7.12","status":"rejected","reason":"House of sacrifice is a strong designation, but no carried offering, journey or spoken Name; Deut 12:11 is fuller.","paragraphs":[],"evidence":["WLC:2Chr.7.12"],"annotations":[]}
